{'symbol': 'MGM', 'date': '2021-04-20 09:00:00', 'title': 'BETMGM TO INTEGRATE GAMESENSE RESPONSIBLE GAMING PROGRAM INTO MOBILE GAMING', 'text': 'JERSEY CITY, N.J., APRIL 20, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BETMGM, THE MOBILE SPORTS BETTING AND IGAMING COMPANY, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT WILL INTEGRATE INTO ITS PLATFORM GAMESENSE, AN INNOVATIVE RESPONSIBLE GAMING PROGRAM LICENSED TO MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL (NYSE: MGM) BY THE BRITISH COLUMBIA LOTTERY CORPORATION (BCLC).'}